  "bodyHash": "I8Zeydcrk8w=",
  "content": "<h1><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><em><strong>必须安装史诗战斗才能运行！</strong></em></span></h1><h1><span style=\"color:#ffc731\"><em><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1419501/description_5c2bdace-64a9-4ea2-9866-45140c57ad91.png\" alt=\"标题\" width=\"849\" height=\"99\"></strong></em></span></h1><h1><span style=\"color:#ffc731\"><em><strong>自 1.4.0 更新起，此模组需要 <span style=\"color:#f7162c\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/weapons-of-miracles-epicfight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">奇迹武器</a> </span></strong></em></span><em><strong>&amp;</strong></em><span style=\"color:#ffc731\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#f7162c\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epicfight-resurrection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">史诗战斗：复活！</a></span></strong></em></span></h1><h2><span style=\"color:#38d978\"><em><strong>此模组还内置了针对史诗战斗：复活的补丁，因为最新版本的史诗战斗会导致模组出错，所以我修复了这个问题！</strong></em></span></h2><h2><strong><span style=\"color:#f7162c\"><span style=\"color:#e41b2f\">注意：请不要在评论区提交问题！请使用此页面顶部的</span> <span style=\"color:#fbb44c\">'<a style=\"color:#fbb44c\" href=\"https://github.com/Thunderstrike597/Weapons-Of-Harmony/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">问题页面</a>' <span style=\"color:#f7162c\"><span style=\"color:#e41b2f\">来提交！</span></span></span></span></strong></h2><h3><strong>--------------------------------------------------------</strong></h3><h2><span style=\"color:#38d978\"><strong>如果你喜欢我的作品，请考虑加入我的 Patreon！</strong></span></h2><h3><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>即使你不想付费或无法付费，也请考虑加入免费层级，因为我希望能在那里建立一个社区！</strong></span></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><h1><span style=\"color:#40d3ff\"><strong><a style=\"color:#40d3ff\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/kenjimods/posts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">我的 Patreon！</a></strong></span></h1><h3><strong>--------------------------------------------------------</strong></h3><h1><strong>武器：</strong></h1><h2><strong>小太刀：</strong></h2><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1419501/description_89874e2a-fdb3-4939-96e1-cd66c1d07982.png\" alt=\"小太刀\" width=\"358\" height=\"358\"></strong></p><h3><strong>小太刀是一把优雅的单手刀，可以切开一切……虽然设计用于单手使用，另一手持鞘，但你天生技能使其在充能后可以使用双手动作！</strong></h3><h2><strong>仲裁之刃：</strong></h2><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1419501/description_30fde4d4-d80f-46ec-9643-5ed506f17caf.png\" alt=\"仲裁之刃\" width=\"353\" height=\"353\"></strong></p><h3><strong>仲裁之刃是一把神秘而稀有的古代剑，可在遍布于特定生物群系类型中的剑龛中找到。</strong></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>虽然这把剑看似普通，但当其内在能力被激活时，你每次挥动都能释放出魔法切割刃，切开一切。</strong></h3><h2><strong>铁扇：</strong></h2><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1419501/description_aaa72b0f-624b-47c1-9572-49d3856741ba.png\" width=\"352\" height=\"352\"></strong></p><h3><strong>铁扇是一件战争扇，不仅适合常规近战，还是一种极其危险的远程武器。瞄准时，你可以极速投掷铁扇，砍倒一切挡路之物，直到它返回你手中（然后你可以再来一次））。</strong></h3><h2><strong>爪：</strong></h2><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1419501/description_21f95911-2bef-436f-8547-51adcb7a6721.png\" width=\"351\" height=\"347\"></strong></p><h3><strong>爪是一对锋利的爪子，可以撕碎任何接触之物。当其内在能力激活时，你会进入愤怒状态，提升攻击速度和伤害！</strong></h3><h2><strong>天雷 <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">（尚未发布！）</span>：</strong></h2><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1419501/description_c6d3560b-00ee-4137-bbb2-98f30ee85c25.png\" width=\"354\" height=\"360\"></strong></p><h3><strong>天雷……一把神秘的双刃分离武器……</strong></h3><h3><strong>曾由古代僧侣使用，这是一把用于杂技般精准地砍倒任何挡路敌群的武器。这把武器还能在计量条充满时，暂时分裂为一对剑/匕首……</strong></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>--------------------------------------------------------</strong></p><h1><strong>动作/武器：</strong></h1><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h3><strong>目前此模组共有 4 种武器和 1 套盔甲：</strong></h3>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h2><strong>1: --- 仲裁之刃 ---</strong></h2>\n<h3><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1419501/description_b016dd00-899d-4198-a83e-d812bcbad342.gif\" alt=\"仲裁之刃展示\" width=\"343\" height=\"218\"><br></strong></h3>\n<h3><strong>--------------------------------------------------------<br></strong></h3>\n<h2><strong>2: --- 小太刀 ---</strong></h2>\n<h3><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0efc3a98-60fa-4560-8240-1580cce5caac.gif\" alt=\"小太刀\" width=\"347\" height=\"196\"></strong></h3>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h2><strong>3: --- 铁扇 ---</strong></h2>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_583f0284-e64f-4e60-9d09-f21bd2a81275.gif\" alt=\"铁扇\" width=\"344\" height=\"186\"></strong></p>\n<h2><strong>4: --- 爪 ---</strong></h2>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0d2035f6-6e93-4c27-bc4e-747ddc8d0f0a.gif\" alt=\"爪\" width=\"344\" height=\"180\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div><h1><strong><br>--------------------------------------------------------<br>新生物变种：</strong></h1><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>流浪武士骷髅：<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_4f87c39f-5b53-4c7d-a333-ed48d6c57cb8.png\" alt=\"流浪武士骷髅\" width=\"278\" height=\"251\"><br></strong></h2>\n<h2><strong>铁扇掠夺者：<br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a222e833-1d4d-4574-9205-ef0b34559318.png\" alt=\"铁扇掠夺者\" width=\"279\" height=\"297\"></strong></h2>\n<h2><strong>利爪僵尸村民：</strong></h2>\n<h2><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_45b041f9-3d2c-4774-8e80-a3a541442953.png\" alt=\"利爪僵尸村民\" width=\"273\" height=\"321\"></strong></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div><h2><strong><br>--------------------------------------------------------</strong></h2><h2><strong>古代剑龛：</strong></h2><h2><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1419501/description_9c668cbd-ac20-45e5-b0f1-6f4f6a036867.png\" alt=\"剑龛\" width=\"422\" height=\"380\"></strong></h2><h2><strong>--------------------------------------------------------</strong></h2><h2><strong>仲裁者套装：</strong></h2><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1419501/description_b31abaf0-6a2f-43d5-9f45-f533d50a24a9.png\" alt=\"仲裁者套装\" width=\"327\" height=\"319\"></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1419501/description_eddbe5c7-6000-4e0a-bfcc-d78eac3b0210.png\" alt=\"流浪武士套装\" width=\"325\" height=\"332\"></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>--------------------------------------------------------</strong></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>希望你喜欢！目前仅支持 1.20.1 和旧版本的史诗战斗，但我正在努力升级以支持新版本的史诗战斗！<br><br>问：我能在整合包中使用吗？<br>答：这还用问吗？当然可以！:P<br><br>问：我能制作资源包吗？<br>答：当然可以！<br><br></strong></h2><h2><strong>问：我能在此处或其他地方重新上传此模组吗？<br>答：不行……</strong></h2><h1><strong><br><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><em>玩得开心！</em></span></strong></h1>",
